Subject: [PATCH] [BACKPORT] sched/fair: backport EEVDF scheduler from Linux 6.6

Backport the Earliest Eligible Virtual Deadline First (EEVDF) scheduling
algorithm from upstream Linux 6.6 to GKI 5.10.

